direction: down
title: GPTpatient modernization · Delivery

// Local and production deployment requests.
u01: Local Compose starts Nuxt · API · PostgreSQL · Redis · background workers { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
u02: Configure Redis event stream · background persistence · 20-minute expiry · 72-hour archive { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
u03: Expose only web entry point to host { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
u04: Bind PostgreSQL / Redis to private Compose network { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
u05: Keep credentials in ignored env file or secret manager { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
u06: Build immutable · pinned Nuxt and API images { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
u07: Terminate HTTPS at ingress proxy { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
u08: Route /api and SSE to Express API { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
u09: Route authenticated audio WebSocket to API { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
u10: Keep PostgreSQL / Redis private { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
u11: Configure health · readiness · graceful socket drain { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
u12: Enforce body size · origin / CSRF · rate limits { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
