// Greenfield implementation sequence and explicit acceptance gates.
g01: 1 · Define seed · expansion · event · phase · action · retention schemas { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
g02: Medical educators review sample cases and rubric { shape: diamond; style.fill: "#FFF0C2"; style.stroke: "#77520A"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
g03: 2 · Implement OIDC · tenant ownership · roles · entitlements · quotas { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
g04: Verify cross-tenant session access is denied { shape: diamond; style.fill: "#FFF0C2"; style.stroke: "#77520A"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
g05: 3 · Add PostgreSQL constraints and idempotent structured setup { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
g06: Verify setup retries preserve exactly the same seed { shape: diamond; style.fill: "#FFF0C2"; style.stroke: "#77520A"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
g07: 4 · Build serialized Responses turns · expansions · disclosure · reconnect { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
g08: Verify accepted facts survive reconnect and remain consistent { shape: diamond; style.fill: "#FFF0C2"; style.stroke: "#77520A"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
g09: 5 · Build fixed results · consent-aware exams · assessment · debrief { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
g10: Verify unsupported findings and results cannot be created { shape: diamond; style.fill: "#FFF0C2"; style.stroke: "#77520A"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
g11: 6 · Ship Transcript; prototype private server-bridged Full Audio { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
g12: Verify reconnect · LED turn-taking · transcript reconciliation · privacy { shape: diamond; style.fill: "#FFF0C2"; style.stroke: "#77520A"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
g13: 7 · Ship Nuxt / API with PostgreSQL · Redis JSON · archive lifecycle { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
g14: 8 · Educator evaluation · load tests · latency and cost budgets { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
g15: Do quality and performance evidence meet release criteria? { shape: diamond; style.fill: "#FFF0C2"; style.stroke: "#77520A"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
g16: Release after clinical · security · reliability gates pass { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
